      "id": "a_mask_t",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 976,
      "width": 568,
      "height": 64,
      "text": "The mask is built by broadcasting only, and it is isolating.\nOption i sees (state, question, option i) and nothing else.\nSo every route from state to decision runs through the option vectors.",
      "originalText": "The mask is built by broadcasting only, and it is isolating.\nOption i sees (state, question, option i) and nothing else.\nSo every route from state to decision runs through the option vectors.",
