    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c_note",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 386,
      "width": 790,
      "height": 36,
      "text": "Under the isolating mask, option i can only be a function of (state, question, option i).\nctx is therefore a genuinely new channel into the head — not a reshape of an existing path.",
