    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "d_pad_t",
      "x": 2118,
      "y": 558,
      "width": 544,
      "height": 88,
      "text": "PADDING TRAP — torch's cross_entropy spreads the smoothing over\npadded columns too: a 2-option noul row inside a 17-option batch\nreturns 2.5e+07 instead of 0.71.  45.35% of questions are 2-option,\nso this is the common case. The corrected form is provably identical\nto torch's when nothing is padded, and gives padding zero gradient.",
      "originalText": "PADDING TRAP — torch's cross_entropy spreads the smoothing over\npadded columns too: a 2-option noul row inside a 17-option batch\nreturns 2.5e+07 instead of 0.71.  45.35% of questions are 2-option,\nso this is the common case. The corrected form is provably identical\nto torch's when nothing is padded, and gives padding zero gradient.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#991b1b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
