      "id": "d_cal_t",
      "x": 2118,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 544,
      "height": 98,
      "text": "calibrate.py — one T_type per question type, fitted by NLL\non the 21,127-question calib split, carved before any training.\nevaluate.py — ECE, 10 bins, top-label, before and after, per type.\n\nGate: no worse than the reference —  0.0122 (default) / 0.0381 (all)",
      "originalText": "calibrate.py — one T_type per question type, fitted by NLL\non the 21,127-question calib split, carved before any training.\nevaluate.py — ECE, 10 bins, top-label, before and after, per type.\n\nGate: no worse than the reference —  0.0122 (default) / 0.0381 (all)",
