      "y": 1198,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "1   reference bev-decider-0.4B on our test split\n2   reference on 5,000 of the default split — validates the 74.7\n3   baseline replica        4   v2        5   delta (4) − (3)\n6   calibration before / after, per type\n7   order gate on trained weights    8   JevBench 231 / sysone 1,240\n9   Tier-2 ablations, one flag at a time, same budget",
      "originalText": "1   reference bev-decider-0.4B on our test split\n2   reference on 5,000 of the default split — validates the 74.7\n3   baseline replica        4   v2        5   delta (4) − (3)\n6   calibration before / after, per type\n7   order gate on trained weights    8   JevBench 231 / sysone 1,240\n9   Tier-2 ablations, one flag at a time, same budget",
