      "text": "input_ids        [B, L]        int64    L = prefix + options + 4 answer tokens\nposition_ids     [B, L]        int64    every option restarts at P; answer at max(pos)+1\nattention_mask   [B, 1, L, L]  float32  additive, 0 / −inf\noption_read_idx  [B, C]        int64    C = max options in the batch (2..17 measured)\noption_mask      [B, C]        bool     True = a real option\noption_seg       [B, L]        int64    option index per token, −1 elsewhere\nranks            [B, C]        float32  level rank in [0,1]; 0 for choice / noul\nprefix_len       [B]           int64    P per row\ntask_type        [B]           int64    0 choice / 1 noul / 2 score\nlabels           [B]           int64",
      "originalText": "input_ids        [B, L]        int64    L = prefix + options + 4 answer tokens\nposition_ids     [B, L]        int64    every option restarts at P; answer at max(pos)+1\nattention_mask   [B, 1, L, L]  float32  additive, 0 / −inf\noption_read_idx  [B, C]        int64    C = max options in the batch (2..17 measured)\noption_mask      [B, C]        bool     True = a real option\noption_seg       [B, L]        int64    option index per token, −1 elsewhere\nranks            [B, C]        float32  level rank in [0,1]; 0 for choice / noul\nprefix_len       [B]           int64    P per row\ntask_type        [B]           int64    0 choice / 1 noul / 2 score\nlabels           [B]           int64",
