      "x": 1130,
      "y": 1662,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "backbone   Qwen3Model(20L, LoRA)  →  hidden  [B, L, 1024]\noption_h   hidden[b, option_read_idx] →           [B, C, 1024]\nprefix_h   hidden[:, :max(P)]         →           [B, P, 1024]\nanswer_h   hidden[b, answer_end_idx]  →           [B, 1024]  v1 only\n\nThe mask is built by broadcasting only.\nblocks:  0 = prefix · 1..K = option i\n        K+1 = answer · −1 = padding",
      "originalText": "backbone   Qwen3Model(20L, LoRA)  →  hidden  [B, L, 1024]\noption_h   hidden[b, option_read_idx] →           [B, C, 1024]\nprefix_h   hidden[:, :max(P)]         →           [B, P, 1024]\nanswer_h   hidden[b, answer_end_idx]  →           [B, 1024]  v1 only\n\nThe mask is built by broadcasting only.\nblocks:  0 = prefix · 1..K = option i\n        K+1 = answer · −1 = padding",
