      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t1_l",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 1966,
      "width": 850,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "1.1  Perceiver ctx summarizer — 8 latent queries, prefix slice only\n1.2  Two position-free option blocks — self-MHA + cross-MHA onto ctx\n1.3  type_emb (3, 512) + rank_mlp on score only; --use_null 0 by default\n1.4  LoRA r=16, α=32, attention + MLP, all 20 kept layers\n1.5  Smoothed CE over valid options + 0.5 · EMD on score rows\n1.6  Option order reshuffled every epoch — deterministic, resumable\n1.7  Per-type temperature on a held-out calibration split; ECE reported\n1.8  Order-invariance hard gate — fp32, many shuffles, k ∈ [3,12]",
      "originalText": "1.1  Perceiver ctx summarizer — 8 latent queries, prefix slice only\n1.2  Two position-free option blocks — self-MHA + cross-MHA onto ctx\n1.3  type_emb (3, 512) + rank_mlp on score only; --use_null 0 by default\n1.4  LoRA r=16, α=32, attention + MLP, all 20 kept layers\n1.5  Smoothed CE over valid options + 0.5 · EMD on score rows\n1.6  Option order reshuffled every epoch — deterministic, resumable\n1.7  Per-type temperature on a held-out calibration split; ECE reported\n1.8  Order-invariance hard gate — fp32, many shuffles, k ∈ [3,12]",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
