    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t2_l",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 1966,
      "width": 830,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "--num_layers 24      depth 24, +62,923,776 params; target unknown\n--pool mean          mean-pool the option, not last-content-token\n--mode special       four new tokens <state> <q> <opt> <opt_end>\n--use_derived 1      dates / money / units pre-pass, dropped 15% of the time\n--use_null 1         learned null option (+512); default off\n--resume <ckpt>      stage-2 hard-negative fine-tune, lr ÷ 4\n\nKeeping --mode bev as the default is what keeps serialisation\nidentical across arms, so the head comparison stays clean.\nNo synthetic data — the mixture already carries numeric_temporal\nand counterfactual, and rule 3 is identical data in both arms.",
      "originalText": "--num_layers 24      depth 24, +62,923,776 params; target unknown\n--pool mean          mean-pool the option, not last-content-token\n--mode special       four new tokens <state> <q> <opt> <opt_end>\n--use_derived 1      dates / money / units pre-pass, dropped 15% of the time\n--use_null 1         learned null option (+512); default off\n--resume <ckpt>      stage-2 hard-negative fine-tune, lr ÷ 4\n\nKeeping --mode bev as the default is what keeps serialisation\nidentical across arms, so the head comparison stays clean.\nNo synthetic data — the mixture already carries numeric_temporal\nand counterfactual, and rule 3 is identical data in both arms.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
