    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t3_cap",
      "x": 1820,
      "y": 1922,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 22,
      "text": "TIER 3 — DOCUMENTED, NOT BUILT · rather say so than ship a stub",
      "originalText": "TIER 3 — DOCUMENTED, NOT BUILT · rather say so than ship a stub",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 61018,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 62018,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t3_l",
      "x": 1820,
      "y": 1966,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "Multilingual augmentation — language: [en]; the gate should be\ndeleted rather than kept as an aspiration.\nSoft-label distillation — 8,131 rows carry label_probs, but the\nteacher is not available here.\n4k context curriculum — p99 state is 958 tokens; only 7.75% of rows\nexceed 1,024, so a curriculum spends the budget on a 1% tail.\nKV-prefix sharing across questions on one state — cache-aware forward.\nv2-M (Qwen3-1.7B) — every budget decision re-measured at 3× the size.\nint8 / ONNX / MLX export and the API server — a separate project; the\norder gate in tests.py is the thing that has to survive all of it.",
      "originalText": "Multilingual augmentation — language: [en]; the gate should be\ndeleted rather than kept as an aspiration.\nSoft-label distillation — 8,131 rows carry label_probs, but the\nteacher is not available here.\n4k context curriculum — p99 state is 958 tokens; only 7.75% of rows\nexceed 1,024, so a curriculum spends the budget on a 1% tail.\nKV-prefix sharing across questions on one state — cache-aware forward.\nv2-M (Qwen3-1.7B) — every budget decision re-measured at 3× the size.\nint8 / ONNX / MLX export and the API server — a separate project; the\norder gate in tests.py is the thing that has to survive all of it.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
