    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cs_t3",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 2402,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 36,
      "text": "Measured on an RTX 4050 Laptop (6 GiB, bf16 autocast, gradient checkpointing); this card cannot do the real run.\nThe notebook prices your SageMaker instance at runtime — these numbers are the floor to sanity-check against, not the estimate.",
      "originalText": "Measured on an RTX 4050 Laptop (6 GiB, bf16 autocast, gradient checkpointing); this card cannot do the real run.\nThe notebook prices your SageMaker instance at runtime — these numbers are the floor to sanity-check against, not the estimate.",
