    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "d_sv_t",
      "x": 2118,
      "y": 1406,
      "width": 544,
      "height": 116,
      "text": "choice / noul   argmax over the valid options only\nscore           an ordinal level, trained with the EMD term\n\nat evaluation   the per-type temperature is applied to BOTH arms\n\nNo response field is invented: a learned null would add a field\nthe Jev contract does not have, and would steal probability mass\nfrom the 76.6% of choice rows that have no abstention option.",
      "originalText": "choice / noul   argmax over the valid options only\nscore           an ordinal level, trained with the EMD term\n\nat evaluation   the per-type temperature is applied to BOTH arms\n\nNo response field is invented: a learned null would add a field\nthe Jev contract does not have, and would steal probability mass\nfrom the 76.6% of choice rows that have no abstention option.",
